{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DnB Starfighter: High-Octane Shoot 'em up</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DnB Starfighter</strong> delivers a relentless shoot 'em up experience where skill reign supreme. Set against the pulsating backdrop of heavy drum and bass tracks by Ruzer, this high-paced shmup challenges you to push your limits and claim your spot on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate increasingly chaotic patterns of enemy fire while the music intensifies around you. When the bass drops, brace yourself as devastating comets hurtle toward your ship, testing your reflexes and evasion skills to their breaking point.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613230?t=1761793260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613230/e68d5e3a05f289594d66bc3d6436d7acc06abc03/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761793260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613230/1b6c928b839a279f4b30289abca2b87df5d00d34/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761793260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613230/1b6c928b839a279f4b30289abca2b87df5d00d34/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761793260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DnB Starfighter: High-Octane Shoot 'em up</stro